  "body": "### Summary\nAs a SwiftHFR user, I want a new topic and a deleted topic reported as done when HFR confirms them, so that I am not told the result is unknown.\n\n### Scope\nPR #394 settled E14: `W40` \"Votre message a été posté avec succès !\" refreshes to the **category** list `/hfr/<cat>/liste_sujet-1.htm` with no topic id; `W49` (first-post `delete=1`) \"Message effacé avec succès !\" refreshes to the sub-category list and deletes the whole topic (`R92` 404 afterwards). Check that the LOT-048 engine confirms both (and handles the missing topic id), and that a first-post delete is reported as a topic delete. Also `W41`: a poll can be added by the first-post edit form (`have_sondage`, `textreponse0..10`).\n\n### Depends on\n#394. Not a Mac task.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Posting tests read W40, W41, W49 and R92.",
